    "LsyimjC_F": {
      "type": "string",
      "value": "Arrows came to us looking to establish a bold presence in the competitive workspace management sector. Their innovative platform needed an identity that would resonate with both corporate decision-makers and everyday users while maintaining visual impact across all touchpoints."
    },
    "sXkke4r2E": {
      "type": "string",
      "value": "Arrows had developed a powerful workspace management platform but struggled to communicate its value effectively to different stakeholder groups. Their existing brand assets lacked consistency and failed to capture the dynamic, innovative nature of their product, while their web presence didn't effectively showcase the platform's capabilities or build trust with enterprise clients."
    },
