        "srcSet": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/xO99vY6Qs9LHIteWaHTR4yOa9hU.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1900&height=1425 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/xO99vY6Qs9LHIteWaHTR4yOa9hU.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1900&height=1425 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/xO99vY6Qs9LHIteWaHTR4yOa9hU.jpg?width=1900&height=1425 1900w",
        "pixelWidth": 1900,
        "pixelHeight": 1425
      }
    },
    "POmBl6Cfz": {
      "type": "string",
      "value": "We crafted a refined brand identity that balanced organic elements with contemporary minimalism, using a carefully curated color palette inspired by the brand's signature botanical ingredients. The packaging design incorporated subtle textural elements and environmentally conscious materials, while maintaining an elevated aesthetic that positioned Chantalle firmly in the luxury beauty space. Each product tells a story through thoughtful typography and delicate illustrations that highlight its natural origins."
    },
