      "type": "string",
      "value": "The London Museum sought to revolutionize visitor wayfinding and information delivery through a comprehensive graphic design system that would enhance the museum experience. Our challenge was to create intuitive, engaging navigational graphics that would guide visitors seamlessly while capturing the museum's rich historical narrative."
