    "sXkke4r2E": {
      "type": "string",
      "value": "Traditional museum signage often feels clinical and disconnected from the storytelling experience, creating visitor confusion and reducing engagement. The London Museum needed a graphic system that could effectively guide visitors, provide clear information, and maintain the immersive, educational atmosphere of the museum's exhibits."
