    "LsyimjC_F": {
      "type": "string",
      "value": "Interference, an innovative audio technology company, needed a poster design that would capture the essence of their groundbreaking sound manipulation technology. Our challenge was to create a visual representation that would communicate the complex science of sound wave interference in a compelling, artistic manner."
    },
    "sXkke4r2E": {
      "type": "string",
      "value": "The company required a poster that could translate technical acoustic principles into a visually arresting design that would appeal to both technical professionals and creative audiences. The design needed to convey the sophisticated nature of sound wave interactions while remaining accessible and engaging."
